  "prefLabel": "Rko 102.04 Annual Reports",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 102.04 Annual Reports. Each year, on or before February 15, the office shall submit a report of its operations in the preceding calendar year to:\n\n(a) The governor of New Hampshire and the executive council;\n\n(b) The New Hampshire senate and house judiciary committees; and\n\n(c) The chief justices of the New Hampshire supreme and superior courts.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
